# COPIES OF ROHAN'S REAL DECK AND REGISTER. Every session before a write drops a
# full pair in here -- the deck alone is 49MB -- and the folder reached 48MB
# untracked and unignored, one `git add -A` away from being welded into history
# permanently. Ignored rather than tidied: the backups must keep being written,
# they just must never be committed.
#
# NOT a blanket ignore on Office files. test-fixtures/*.pptx are TRACKED on
# purpose -- run_vba_tests.ps1 stages shp-groupshape.pptx into every suite run,
# so ignoring them by extension would break the suite on a fresh clone.
backups/

# Working copies and carved-out originals. NEXT-SESSION.md references
# scratchpad/ as where a known-good copy of a module is parked mid-edit.
scratchpad/
*.bak
